## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical VM memory management, cross-component protocol, and NUMA-aware eviction under pressure.

## Key Concepts
- Balloon negotiation protocol (inflate/deflate)
- Per-VM quotas and fairness under pressure
- NUMA-aware page reclamation and page-cache interaction
- Hysteresis and cooldown to prevent thrash

## Code Example
```c
// Pseudo: host_reclaim Path sketch
void host_reclaim(vm_t *vms, int pressure) {
  for each vm in vms:
    target = compute_target(vm, pressure);
    while (vm.balloon < target && free_pool_not_empty()) {
      page = select_candidate(vm); // NUMA-aware, LRU, non-dirty
      free_page(page);
      vm.balloon++;
    }
  }
}
```

